    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shred. Crush. Wash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recyclic is a (not so) cozy game about sorting hand-drawn pieces of garbage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to keep on top of your living costs as company policy, government regulation, and personal requests quickly pile up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut. Label. Test</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your workflow and upgrade your company issued equipment to make your job slightly less tedious. Pocket any valuables that end up on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Separate. Sort</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill special requests, perhaps a friendly favor, or something more... profitable. Bring life and color to an otherwise bleak world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shred. Crush. Wash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recyclic is a (not so) cozy game about sorting hand-drawn pieces of garbage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to keep on top of your living costs as company policy, government regulation, and personal requests quickly pile up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut. Label. Test</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your workflow and upgrade your company issued equipment to make your job slightly less tedious. Pocket any valuables that end up on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Separate. Sort</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill special requests, perhaps a friendly favor, or something more... profitable. Bring life and color to an otherwise bleak world.</p>",
    "short_description": "A deceptively demanding experience of a humble recycling plant worker. Shred, crush, and sort your way through a menial job while trying to keep track of the ever convoluted company policy. Clock in, recycle, get paid, repeat.",
